# DRC-WS-2: Same rule; block [0,8]x[0,30] with a line 2 away (no error).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 8 30
paint m1
box 10 0 26 2
paint m1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
